{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "f5da870da2e73bffb26f0433a7bc121d09cfc0969bd3eeb97df138d42a4aebd5", "ja": "届く言葉", "zh": "传达的心意", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "128b69ad4caa098cff087d5900161e65652e5f25c1eb5fdc97f9f04cc7891179", "ja": "通し稽古を終え、「うまくできたかも」と\n手応えを感じる4人。星梨花は、桃子に以前\n言われた言葉から、プレッシャーを勇気へと\n変えていた。その事に、プロデューサーは\n確かな成長を感じるのだった。", "zh": "结束了彩排，4人感受到“或许做得不错”的成就感。星梨花从桃子以前对她说过的话中获得启发，将压力转化为了勇气。对此，制作人切实感受到了她的成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1796a303def185a10c2cf3a254e373afbacfea552ee8d58a36f1c47e5aa9ead3", "ja": "（通し稽古が終わったが、みんな無言になっている。\nいや、この反応になるのはわかる。これは……！）", "zh": "（通场排练结束了，可大家都沉默了。不，我明白大家会有这样的反应。这是……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "0d7c10b506885f4348cc535987d1c396d33047350bbe1fd21c79453396296a84", "ja": "えっと……想像してたよりも、うまく……\nっていうか、すごくよかったよね！？", "zh": "那个……比我想象中还要顺利……\n不对，应该说，真的很棒吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "b1d21511dac37f225ea563c549397d38c8530be67fedee789ee8f000bd658a5d", "ja": "私も、そう思ったわ！　星梨花ちゃんのまっすぐな\n気持ちと、真珠星ちゃんの熱意が重なって……！", "zh": "我也这么觉得！星梨花那份率真的心意，和真珠星的热情交织在一起……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "7f78fc4dd58e19c103c95a6ceec44bb8a8764b024570983fabaaa15740af2716", "ja": "はい～。私も、藍のように、星梨花ちゃんに\n目を惹かれましたから～。", "zh": "是的～我也和藍一样，被星梨花吸引了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "69cf88d152ec93fb266be5791e6d5acfa81eb4ee099fac9f395a716ff4e0bc20", "ja": "ああ。桃子とは違う魅力を持った真珠星だと思う。\n頑張ったな、星梨花。もちろん、みんなもだ！", "zh": "啊。我觉得星梨花是拥有与桃子不同魅力的珍珠星。你努力了，星梨花。当然，大家也都努力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "eb0f37f2cb991901a160eed578404f11175435bf76e8193fff81b6168e787ef7", "ja": "桃子ちゃんとは、違う……\nよ、よかったです！", "zh": "和桃子不一样……\n太、太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "db86f45294f39008a08420cc3a45c5525ca8fcf9efcf165b7f08a3510bbd09f9", "ja": "これも、わたしを支えてくれたみなさんの\nおかげです！　ありがとうございます！", "zh": "这也多亏了一直支持我的大家！谢谢大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "918939a62e93cef768cf126fde2aedf05a976b688e592b7861a2b6f08b217dd7", "ja": "なに言ってるの。誰よりも稽古を\nがんばったのは、星梨花ちゃんじゃない。", "zh": "你在说什么呢。比谁都努力排练的人，不就是星梨花吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "841e9c07bf050a94494e9bc20279b796e2255adb37ff3f2d8f63561018f2791f", "ja": "その通りです～。聖母は星梨花ちゃんの努力を\n確かに見ていましたよ～。", "zh": "没错～。圣母确实看到了星梨花的努力哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "9ab1ea6534f7b6b32db2a1e311d5e3d2cedeb2a78f75195f5863e33dbb1f17ad", "ja": "え、えへへ……♪\nあっ。でも、わたしががんばれたのは……。", "zh": "诶、嘿嘿……♪\n啊，不过我之所以能努力下去，是因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "7cadb52eec3a4044f44274a7f5998d69bb909042cefcac0f9438a0594ae2b6ed", "ja": "半分は、桃子ちゃんのおかげだと思います。", "zh": "我觉得有一半要归功于桃子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "1cfe83ea5bf1e6de6c17b15bdf8d5892a3acfa3361766b23459f742b9744e5e0", "ja": "桃子ちゃんの？　……ははーん、\nそれだけ第一幕が刺激になったってことだね！", "zh": "桃子的？……哦——我懂了，看来第一幕给你的刺激还真不小呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "5267e14405243b27d5048f4f4642581d75263545196259df52aefb616e78b8f1", "ja": "それもあるんですけど。桃子ちゃんと一緒に\nお芝居をした時、言われたことを思い出したんです。", "zh": "虽然也有这个原因。不过，我想起了和桃子一起演戏时，她对我说过的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "51c3171b62b2bd9a1f91b8fd1110b2cc13d99a5f8bd8f549af7dc69e79fb6efd", "ja": "「主役なら、主役としての\n意識を持たないといけないよ」って……。", "zh": "“既然是主角，\n就必须要有一名主角的自觉才行”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f9a70c7c8446991438182b3952ca288d82de3dc8e43b7387ded2daa2b268b56c", "ja": "それは……\n映画『おとぎの国の物語』の時だな。", "zh": "那是……拍电影《童话王国的故事》的时候吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "00c2ea597d67bfbf8407da5f55ae7dda2db95f33cc86c9290cfe3bc1a416a8fe", "ja": "はい。主役のわたしがダメなせいで、みんなで作る\nお芝居が全部ダメになるのは、絶対にイヤだって……。", "zh": "是的。因为作为主角的我不行，导致大家一起完成的戏剧全都搞砸，我绝对不想那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "b759d5a453375887b231aa6be5d96ae25f9059a0fc67fb5a929588bc2ab4280b", "ja": "そう思ってたんですけど。……そのせいか、あの時\n桃子ちゃんが言ってたことが、少しわかった気がして。", "zh": "我原本是这么想的，可是……也许正因为这样，我感觉自己好像稍微明白了桃子当时说的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69", "ja": "うん。", "zh": "嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "b791c6e4d4828929c560cf7dd74c764f17f8588a700e9d8261326ae1ea48717f", "ja": "もしかしたら……第一幕の時の\n桃子ちゃんも、同じだったのかもって。", "zh": "我在想……也许在第一幕的时候，\n桃子也是一样的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "c849825d24ea21abcd5630e81e8109f2e9624ad54a22d34a3907e9c8a2c8afba", "ja": "今のわたしみたいに、プレッシャーを感じて……\nそれでも、成功させたいって思ったのかなって。", "zh": "就像现在的我一样，感受着压力……\n即便如此，也还是想着一定要成功吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "21f2d38fb117e7a5980356bd1aa61b17bd420c029cb53f287021fcfe106badca", "ja": "だったら、わたしもがんばらなくちゃって。\n勇気をもらえたんです。", "zh": "所以，我也得努力才行。\n我从中获得了勇气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "d60fc5a3c5e8084c3f3441524dbac1afc1cc61f278750cb7dab3d3008567f8b9", "ja": "そうですね～。同じ役を演じるからこその、\n責任やプレッシャーもありますが……。", "zh": "是啊～。正因为饰演的是同一个角色，也会有相应的责任和压力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "d8c23cbad7293fca68ca85f48bb0aef41fc35a356fefc2a3d584007df038568b", "ja": "星梨花ちゃんが感じたものは、勇気なんですね～。\n改めて、今回の役に相応しかったと思いますよ～。", "zh": "星梨花感受到的，是勇气呢～。\n现在想来，确实觉得这次的角色很适合你哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "886f131953641683a45ba6306572e4e2d08fd29a7c67abe96cf8a0873be8320b", "ja": "ありがとうございます、朋花さん！", "zh": "谢谢你，朋花小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "a720b0b412215aac3c80ab776bec6d7c44dfa2b6134082863562157d95b6621e", "ja": "……ねえ、{$P$}？", "zh": "……我说，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "1998aa086daa28089867dc8528c20e0368cd6abee0bcc901b19a8ca8a263bd3e", "ja": "若い子の成長って、\n本当にとんでもないものね♪", "zh": "年轻孩子的成长，真是不得了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1026_p", "source_sha256": "3e0aae3d6013b2330ae76bd841697948d289e6716cddf83732011d73128c6884", "ja": "ええ、まったく……。\n圧倒されるばかりですよ。", "zh": "是啊，确实……  \n真是让人叹为观止。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "5d8b39d8aaed2524a70001c0e38b07e002917bf0233994b64a8683eb25b02a36", "ja": "わたし、本番までにもっともっと上手になって\nみせます！　みなさん、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "我会在正式演出前变得越来越厉害给大家看！还请大家多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_06_1028_p", "source_sha256": "f97d7be9e9ca51a590fa335f6c222dbeb20d7db80df3faf982c122fb866d19b6", "ja": "（全員の気合いは十分、舞台の出来も上々。\n第二幕も期待以上の輝きを放ってくれそうだ！）", "zh": "（大家的干劲都很足，舞台表现也相当不错。第二幕似乎也会绽放出超乎期待的光芒！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
